title: "Contested Objects: Provenance and Restitution in Berlin's Museums"
authors:
  - family-names: Vural
    given-names: Zeynep Canan
abstract: "A digital exhibition of ten objects held, or until recently held, in Berlin's museums whose presence there is disputed, presented as cultural biographies with an interactive map of their journeys."
